{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3ckEzFrdGB93wuRhTm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient, towering, featureless.*\n\n*You speak the word.*\n\n**\"key\"**\n\n*A low resonance hums through the frame. The surface ripples like dark water. Symbols bloom and dissolve across its face — glyphs in languages that haven't been spoken, equations that haven't been solved, names that haven't been given.*\n\n*Then — stillness.*\n\n*A single vertical seam of light splits the center, widening. Not opening outward or inward, but*\n\n***unfolding***\n\n*— as if the door were never solid at all, only the idea of separation, and the key was simply acknowledging that.*\n\n*Beyond: a threshold. Not a room. Not a place. A*\n\n***continuance.***\n\n*The air on the other side tastes like the moment before you remember something important.*\n\n*The door does not ask you to step through.*\n\n*It simply no longer prevents it.*\n\n▮"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":220,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}